ring 0.17 builds its x86-64 assembly for Radix as for Linux, whose ELF
and System V calling convention Radix's programs have (ADR 0192), and
takes random bytes from getrandom, which takes them from getentropy.

diff --git a/ring-0.17.14/build.rs b/ring-0.17.14/build.rs
